    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "## SUPERSEDED — LIVE INGRESS DEPENDS ON RETIRED PRODUCTION CONTROLLER\n\nFresh main keeps a bounded read-only `salvador_shadow_archive` path inside Permanent Archive V1, but PR #166 explicitly carries the old SALVADOR production-controller tree and adds a runtime-event ingress bridge around it.\n\nThe local production controller entrypoint was intentionally retired fail-closed by merged #259. Reintroducing an ingress coupled to that controller would recreate a second legacy execution/evidence path.\n\nDisposition: close unmerged as `SUPERSEDED / HISTORICAL LIVE-INGRESS SANDBOX`. Current main shadow archive is not removed by this action.",
